  "abstract": "Dataset produced by paper \"Ousiometrics: The essence of meaning aligns with a power\u2013danger\u2013structure framework instead of valence\u2013arousal\u2013dominance\" by Dodds et al. Scores for words in a three dimensional space of essential meaning. Tab-separated columns are: 1. n-gram (mostly individual words) 2. Goodness (vs Badness) 3. Power (vs Weakness) 4. Aggression (vs Gentleness) 5. Danger (vs Safety) 6. Structure (high is unstructured, low is structure) The GPAD circumplex lies in the first two dimensions. Structure is the third dimension. Two minimal orthogonal frameworks are: Goodness-Aggression-Structure (GAS) Power-Danger-Structure (PDS)Power-Danger-Structure aligns with real word usage (tokens), and aligns an array of other systems. Primary plane is spanned by GA or PD frameworks. Connection: Power = 1/sqrt(2) ( Goodness + Aggression) Danger = 1/sqrt(2) (-Goodness + Aggression) = 1/sqrt(2)(Badness + Aggression)",
